1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:06,200
Riya Sharma… the case against you was filed by you.

2
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:20,440
I live alone in Pune, far from home… and I used to feel that everyone in my life had only ever hurt me.

3
00:00:20,902 --> 00:00:24,642
Riya… at least today, pick up the phone, beta…

4
00:00:31,552 --> 00:00:39,272
Neha… Aarav… Maa. The fourth name… later.

5
00:00:50,872 --> 00:00:57,632
That night I fell asleep… and woke up in the court of my own mind.

6
00:01:04,018 --> 00:01:05,998
Where am I… what is this place?

7
00:01:09,028 --> 00:01:14,288
Riya Sharma… the case against you was filed by you.

8
00:01:17,250 --> 00:01:23,550
This court is your own mind. Here, the mirrors don't lie.

9
00:01:24,900 --> 00:01:34,400
You… you are me?

10
00:01:35,250 --> 00:01:43,550
This was my mind… where I was the lawyer, the judge… and the accused.

11
00:01:43,792 --> 00:01:45,075
Three witnesses will come.

12
00:01:45,125 --> 00:01:49,745
I don't need anyone. I am right.

13
00:01:52,007 --> 00:02:01,227
Neha… my friend of fifteen years. She got engaged… and didn't even tell me.

14
00:02:07,517 --> 00:02:09,957
…and she didn't even tell me?

15
00:02:12,357 --> 00:02:17,717
Fifteen years of friendship… and I found out about her engagement on Instagram!

16
00:02:20,967 --> 00:02:28,807
Aarav… the one I loved the most. I thought he had abandoned me.

17
00:02:38,820 --> 00:02:44,600
The one I loved the most… is the one who left.

18
00:02:46,775 --> 00:02:49,105
You humiliated me in front of everyone!

19
00:02:49,155 --> 00:02:53,505
I only wanted to stop you.

20
00:02:55,848 --> 00:02:57,636
An apology?

21
00:02:57,686 --> 00:03:01,968
It was his fault.

22
00:03:06,755 --> 00:03:08,125
Now it's Maa's turn.

23
00:03:14,247 --> 00:03:17,375
Have you eaten, beta?

24
00:03:17,425 --> 00:03:21,897
The same question every time, Maa.

25
00:03:24,083 --> 00:03:34,083
And Maa… who asked just one question every day — have you eaten? That question felt like a burden.

26
00:03:36,533 --> 00:03:38,333
You won't be able to live alone.

27
00:03:46,373 --> 00:03:48,873
You don't care about me at all.

28
00:03:52,583 --> 00:03:55,417
You never understood me. You only asked if I'd eaten.

29
00:04:01,378 --> 00:04:03,516
Do you have the courage to hear the truth, Riya?

30
00:04:03,566 --> 00:04:05,066
Yes…

31
00:04:10,828 --> 00:04:17,528
And then… the mirror showed me what I never wanted to see that day.

32
00:04:18,222 --> 00:04:20,792
Riya, I have something to tell you…

33
00:04:20,842 --> 00:04:24,162
Never mind, you tell me — how was your day?

34
00:04:24,425 --> 00:04:25,408
At least talk to me.

35
00:04:25,458 --> 00:04:26,700
Now…

36
00:04:26,750 --> 00:04:28,270
…there's no point.

37
00:04:32,053 --> 00:04:41,173
But the truth was… she tried so hard to tell me. I was so drowned in my own pain that I couldn't hear her joy.

38
00:04:41,993 --> 00:04:45,213
Riya… please, everyone's watching.

39
00:04:48,093 --> 00:04:50,083
I had a really bad day today, Riya…

40
00:04:50,133 --> 00:04:55,873
Yours was bad? Listen to mine first…

41
00:04:56,842 --> 00:04:59,412
In your story, I can never be right…

42
00:04:59,462 --> 00:05:03,642
because it has only one character.

43
00:05:07,232 --> 00:05:13,972
But he never left me… I never gave him a place in my story.

44
00:05:17,162 --> 00:05:19,462
How will I live alone…

45
00:05:26,942 --> 00:05:28,442
Okay, beta…

46
00:05:42,023 --> 00:05:48,503
I never saw… how empty that house became after I left.

47
00:06:00,853 --> 00:06:02,913
What's the date today, Riya?

48
00:06:06,393 --> 00:06:07,893
…Maa's birthday.

49
00:06:12,453 --> 00:06:17,153
It's alright… she must be busy.

50
00:06:21,033 --> 00:06:27,933
I was so drowned in my own tears… that I never saw Maa's.

51
00:06:29,797 --> 00:06:35,577
Ego doesn't always shout 'me'… sometimes it comes wearing tears.

52
00:06:38,717 --> 00:06:43,237
The truth is… you weren't wrong. You were tired.

53
00:06:46,917 --> 00:06:48,537
Write the fourth name.

54
00:06:53,497 --> 00:06:54,997
…Riya.

55
00:06:58,417 --> 00:07:02,277
Maa… please forgive me…

56
00:07:15,155 --> 00:07:17,315
I understand, Riya.

57
00:07:24,517 --> 00:07:26,077
I'm with you.

58
00:07:29,792 --> 00:07:31,362
The verdict is…

59
00:07:31,412 --> 00:07:34,312
Forgive yourself.

60
00:07:46,022 --> 00:07:47,522
Yes, beta?

61
00:07:49,323 --> 00:07:55,363
Maa… I read all your messages. Is there any rajma left?

62
00:07:59,563 --> 00:08:02,283
I save a little for you every single day.

63
00:08:04,083 --> 00:08:08,223
Happy birthday, Maa… I'm sorry… I'm coming home.

64
00:08:21,453 --> 00:08:29,853
Saying sorry wasn't losing… it was my biggest win.

65
00:08:30,583 --> 00:08:32,083
Have you eaten?

66
00:08:34,173 --> 00:08:35,873
I'm eating with you, Maa.

67
00:08:40,453 --> 00:08:50,083
In all our minds, a court is always in session… where we always find ourselves innocent. Today, just once… look deep into your own mind.

